            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hello!\r\n\r\nI am not sure where `Strong` highlight group comes from. I've never noticed it defined.\r\n\r\nThere is [`Bold`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/06bf1784d88b112de14ce29aa604e2ae3fe1e359/lua/mini/base16.lua#L568) highlight group which can be served same purpose.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hello!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I am not sure where <code class=\"notranslate\">Strong</code> highlight group comes from. I've never noticed it defined.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There is <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/06bf1784d88b112de14ce29aa604e2ae3fe1e359/lua/mini/base16.lua#L568\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Bold</code></a> highlight group which can be served same purpose.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Hello!\nI am not sure where Strong highlight group comes from. I've never noticed it defined.\nThere is Bold highlight group which can be served same purpose.",
