            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "Hi!\r\nI was not clear. This is a short markdown file where **strong** is shown in bold using the catppuccin colorscheme:\r\n[catppuccin](https://i.postimg.cc/rFsThfgz/catppuccin.png)\r\n\r\nThis is the same file using minicyan (bold is not shown):\r\n[minicyan](https://i.postimg.cc/L8T6wJL8/minicyan.png)\r\n\r\nFinally, using minicyan patched (bold is ok):\r\nhttps://i.postimg.cc/MGHxLdz9/minicyan-text-strong.png\r\n\r\nThis is the code I added to mini.base16:\r\n`  hi('@text.strong',     {fg=nil,      bg=nil, attr='bold',      sp=nil})\r\n`\r\n\r\nIn catppuccin there are several @text hl groups such as [this](https://github.com/catppuccin/nvim/blob/2e3e5ebcdc24ef0d5b14a0a999dbbe7936512c46/lua/catppuccin/groups/integrations/treesitter.lua#L96) that are not present in mini.base16.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi!<br>\nI was not clear. This is a short markdown file where <strong>strong</strong> is shown in bold using the catppuccin colorscheme:<br>\n<a href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/rFsThfgz/catppuccin.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">catppuccin</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is the same file using minicyan (bold is not shown):<br>\n<a href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/L8T6wJL8/minicyan.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">minicyan</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Finally, using minicyan patched (bold is ok):<br>\n<a href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MGHxLdz9/minicyan-text-strong.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://i.postimg.cc/MGHxLdz9/minicyan-text-strong.png</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is the code I added to mini.base16:<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\"> hi('@text.strong',     {fg=nil,      bg=nil, attr='bold',      sp=nil})</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In catppuccin there are several <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/text/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/text\">@text</a> hl groups such as <a href=\"https://github.com/catppuccin/nvim/blob/2e3e5ebcdc24ef0d5b14a0a999dbbe7936512c46/lua/catppuccin/groups/integrations/treesitter.lua#L96\">this</a> that are not present in mini.base16.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Hi!\nI was not clear. This is a short markdown file where strong is shown in bold using the catppuccin colorscheme:\ncatppuccin\nThis is the same file using minicyan (bold is not shown):\nminicyan\nFinally, using minicyan patched (bold is ok):\nhttps://i.postimg.cc/MGHxLdz9/minicyan-text-strong.png\nThis is the code I added to mini.base16:\n hi('@text.strong',     {fg=nil,      bg=nil, attr='bold',      sp=nil})\nIn catppuccin there are several @text hl groups such as this that are not present in mini.base16.",
